  abilityDesc: 20 combo powerful Light attack on all foes, enormously boosts own
    Spark damage for 3 turns, Spark damage considerably boosts BB gauge for 3 turns,
    damage taken hugely boosts BB gauge for 3 turns, enormously boosts BB Atk for
    3 turns, hugely boosts Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns & enormously boosts critical
    hit rate for 3 turns
